      "id": 492233,
      "username": "AnneMac666",
      "name": "Anne Mac666",
      "created_at": "2026-01-22T16:44:37.752Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I just encountered this problem a few days ago.</p>\n<p>Our company is using ERPNext on Gcloud VMinstance with the info below:</p>\n<p>erpnext 15.29.2<br>\nfrappe 15.33.3<br>\nhrms 16.0.0-dev<br>\npayments 0.0.1<br>\nprint_designer 1.x.x-develop</p>\n<p>When the user logs in with the company network, everything works fine. However, when they use the other networks, they are stuck with this problem even when they logged in from the start or logged in with the company network and then switched to another network. Same account, same resource, same permission. Happened to all users, including the administrator account, with no ip restriction in place.</p>\n<p>1 thing I check is that the user info (sid, csrf_token, etc) is sent in the header for both cases, but with an outside network, no response returns only 403 for permission denied.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/9/39727f3bc1e5520dde6d9e242ef4d853281e59c4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/39727f3bc1e5520dde6d9e242ef4d853281e59c4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/9/39727f3bc1e5520dde6d9e242ef4d853281e59c4.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8ccwwfup7ry28BqQwf0FRGuTq2U\" width=\"534\" height=\"277\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">534×277 5.27 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
